Professor Juniper: This is a
Pokémon Center!{VAR BE01}
Don't you feel better as soon as you
step through the door?{VAR BE01}
OK, let's start your tour!{VAR BE01}

Professor Juniper: A Pokémon Center is a
truly incredible place!{VAR BE01}
Do you know why?
Because your Pokémon can be healed!{VAR BE00}
And, what's more, it's absolutely free!{VAR BE01}
A Pokémon Center is a Trainer's
best friend!{VAR BE01}
Here, {VAR 0100 0000}, give it a try.

Professor Juniper: Hey, {VAR 0100 0000}.
Where are you off to?{VAR BE01}
Humor me and talk to the lady at the
counter. Let her take your Pokémon.{VAR BE01}

Professor Juniper: OK. Now that your
Pokémon have rested, I'll show you how{VAR BE00}
to use the PC at a Pokémon Center.{VAR BE01}

Professor Juniper: This is the PC.
It's free for any Trainer to use.{VAR BE01}
You can store Pokémon in your PC Boxes
or select Pokémon stored in your{VAR BE00}
PC Boxes to take along with you.{VAR BE01}
In addition, if you catch a new Pokémon
while you have six Pokémon traveling{VAR BE00}
with you, the Pokémon you just caught is{VAR BE00}
sent automatically to the PC network!{VAR BE01}
Surprising, isn't it? Amazing, even.
Here's something else that's cool.{VAR BE01}
If you select my PC, I'll evaluate the
progress you've made on your Pokédex!{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Professor...{VAR BE01}
It says “Someone's PC"
on the screen. Who is Someone?{VAR BE01}

Professor Juniper: Very good, Bianca.
That's a great observation!{VAR BE01}
Good question, and I'd like to say more,
but for now, just ignore that and{VAR BE00}
go ahead and use the PC.{VAR BE01}
“Someone" is the person who made the
Pokémon Storage System.{VAR BE01}
...Someone I'm sure you'll meet someday!
OK, let's move on!{VAR BE01}

Professor Juniper: Now, this is the
Poké Mart.{VAR BE01}
This is the place to buy useful items and
sell the ones you don't need anymore!{VAR BE01}
That gentleman over there will
help you with a smile!{VAR BE01}

Professor Juniper: So, let's
wrap this up.{VAR BE01}
I've given you the basics of being
a Trainer!{VAR BE01}
I'm going to head back to Nuvema Town.{VAR BE01}
One final thing...{VAR BE01}
When you get to Striaton City, go and
meet an inventor named Fennel.{VAR BE01}
She's a friend of mine from long ago, and
I'm sure she'll help you on your way!{VAR BE01}
Best of luck! I hope that your journeys
prove to be the adventure of a lifetime!{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Ooh! What should I buy?{VAR BE01}
Potions and Poké Balls are definitely
important. Ummm...thinking...{VAR BE01}

Be sure to save what's happened up
to this point before you forget.{VAR BE00}
Then you can take a break.
